.TH "pinp-by-faemiyah" "6" "2026-11-17" "piNp User Manuals" ""
.hy
.SH NAME
.PP
pinp-by-faemiyah - run piNp, a 4k intro by Faemiyah
.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
pinp-by-faemiyah
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
piNp is a 4k intro by Faemiyah, released in August 2004 at Assembly
2004, where it ranked 10th in the 4k intro competition.
.PP
Trilkk [Code]
.PD 0
.P
.PD
Juippi [Music]
.PD 0
.P
.PD
Warma [Additional code]
.PP
The soundtrack is synthesized at startup, so the screen stays black for
a short while before the intro begins.
The Debian version runs in a window with V-Sync enabled.
Press any key to quit.
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
This program has no options.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
SDL_VIDEODRIVER
Video driver used by SDL.
The Debian version defaults to x11; set this variable to use another
driver.
